        "vid": "226751fb-a0fe-11f1-ae1f-bc241121aa0a"
    },
    "details": "# Problem Description:\n\nThe implementation of this ioctl attempts to acquire locks on all\nchannels in a sync group. If locking a channel would block, it releases\nthe sync group list lock and sleeps. Upon reawakening, it is possible\nthat the sync group structure is freed, but the implementation did not\nhandle this possibility.\n\n# Impact:\n\nOn a system with a multiple audio devices, an unprivileged local user\ncan exploit this use-after-free to escalate privileges.\n",
